text:
🎪This hour on the #NovaGuestlist: 
@richiejape.bsky.social chats creativity & the exciting new #Hibernacle festival: A new intimate 3-day music event in Orlagh House, Rathfarnham- July 4th-6th!
🎟️Check out the lineup: #PillowQueens #YeVagabonds #LisaHannigan #AilbheReddy +more! #speirgorm #IrishMusic

🗣️Chatting on the #NovaGuestlist now is Diarmuid from  @murdercapital.bsky.social Live from Germany;
📞We're chatting about their album Blindness, their Iveagh Gardens show in July, and the situation right now in Germany as their gigs get cancelled:
📻 #IrishMusicParty #Speirgorm

Barred from a second bar in my area for using the women's toilet last night. Told me to use the men's. And that's something I would have done, with grace, if they let me speak to them about how difficult being trans is.

People aren't even willing to listen. #speirgorm

@padraigrice.bsky.social
